  "ingredients": [
    "1 tablespoon matcha green tea powder, or more to taste",
    "1 cup whole milk",
    "2 cups heavy whipping cream",
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "2 eggs"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mDcXy1KFo-11SXl18lk1XkNG71o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241759-matcha-green-tea-ice-cream-VAT-005-step-01-6f54de8cdde741068953d8e9451f65e4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241759/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk matcha powder in a bowl to remove any lumps. Add a splash of milk and whisk until matcha powder is completely dissolved. Gradually whisk in remaining milk.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VH0qJPb2Ij-4B-32I_Ft3ZTVj2g=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241759-matcha-green-tea-ice-cream-VAT-006-step-02-43a9ef56480f4b1f895cf34ee9e0844f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241759/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer matcha mixture to a pot. Add cream and cook over medium-low heat, stirring occasionally, until heated through, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/17WR6jYCxJGVwlIL8K9piTs36Ys=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241759-matcha-green-tea-ice-cream-VAT-007-step-03-a05545243f474e5e9d17c19de23e1550.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241759/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk sugar and eggs together in a bowl. Pour 1/2 cup hot matcha mixture into egg mixture, whisking quickly until thoroughly combined. Repeat with remaining matcha mixture. Pour mixture back into the pot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_MMHvS-10oyG0bG1srmK1cW0mCw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241759-matcha-green-tea-ice-cream-VAT-008-step-04-02backinpot-9da37dcfc29c42f3a5f243bb14bf4dd1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241759/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook and stir matcha mixture over medium-low heat until heated through, about 3 minutes. Remove from the heat and cool to room temperature, about 20 minutes. Refrigerate until chilled, at least 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aKYWD25uS2w4EZ1h8u_AdGeGHEQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241759-matcha-green-tea-ice-cream-VAT-009-step-05-02-bc305e6314e6425e8bd9be74a97f8148.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241759/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour chilled matcha mixture into an ice cream maker and freeze according to the manufacturer's instructions, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/szrHS0DD3KF6V9w6wkhgvFX21GY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241759-matcha-green-tea-ice-cream-VAT-010-step-06-807b7108143e4b12b12185221a12ddce.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241759/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve or transfer to an airtight container and freeze until desired consistency is reached.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rJAsFGzTrNxF7x_mD2dr7rPv1hA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/241759-matcha-green-tea-ice-cream-VAT-011-step-07-f88b4f1e3c9045119167099cbc106336.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/241759/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
